  "prefLabel": "Rev 801.04 Fair market value",
  "priorExpiration": "2006-02-21",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 801.04 “Fair market value” means the price property would command in an arms length transaction if sold by a transferor who is willing, but not compelled, to sell and purchased by a transferee who is willing, but not compelled, to purchase.\n\nSource. #5300, eff 12-26-91; ss by #6691, eff 2-21-98, EXPIRED: 2-21-06\n\nNew. #8579, eff 3-8-06; ss by #10665, eff 9-9-14; ss by #14071, eff 9-10-24",
